    <sys:String x:Key="AboutTitle">About Egg Launcher</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="AboutProductTab">Product</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="IndependentOpenLocal">Independent, Open Source, Local First</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="AboutProductBody">Egg Launcher is an independently developed open-source Windows tool that coordinates ChatGPT Desktop online environments with llama.cpp local inference environments. It does not provide AI models or online AI services, and it does not bypass third-party accounts, licenses, or access restrictions.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseBoundary">Current Release Scope</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseBoundaryBody">This release is a public beta. Core mode switching, local runtime, and recovery flows have been validated; online model search and download remain experimental. The package does not bundle llama.cpp, CUDA Runtime, GGUF models, or other user-selected inference runtimes. The application's open-source dependencies are listed in the third-party notices.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Developer">Developer</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="SoftwareLicense">License</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="DataHandling">Data Handling</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="DataHandlingValue">No developer server · No outbound telemetry · Stored locally</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="UsePrivacyTab">Privacy</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="FreeAndUse">Free Use</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="FreeAndUseBody">Egg Launcher is provided free of charge under the MIT License. Model downloads, network traffic, electricity, hardware, and third-party services may incur costs and remain subject to their respective terms. The software is provided “as is,” without a promise of permanent maintenance or compatibility with every third-party version.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ViewTerms">View Terms and Disclaimer</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="PrivacySummary">Privacy Summary</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="PrivacySummaryBody">This release has no Egg Launcher account or developer server. It sends no usage analytics, behavior tracking, crash reports, or local performance samples to the developer or third parties. Settings, model profiles, recovery records, and diagnostic logs remain on this device. CPU, memory, GPU, VRAM, and local llama metrics are used only for the current interface.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ViewPrivacy">View Full Privacy Notice</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LocalDataDirectory">Local Data Directory</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LocalDataBody">Model and Runtime data remain in the llama.cpp directory selected by the user. Removing the application files does not automatically remove that data.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ChangelogTab">Changelog</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote099Title">0.9.9 · 2026-10-20</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote099Item1">• Expand Batch Size and Micro Batch options with custom input.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote099Item2">• Add five n-gram speculative decoding strategies with MTP combination support.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote099Item3">• Add MTP, MoE, cache and advanced runtime parameters.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote099Item4">• Add an experimental Custom Parameters tab with separate llama.cpp and Codex settings.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote099Item5">• Improve duplicate parameter checks, syntax validation and Codex configuration restoration.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote099Item6">• Add recheck actions for templates, external MTP files and vision modules.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote099Item7">• Improve capability checks and validation reuse to prevent invalidation by unrelated settings.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote099Item8">• Clarify save and startup validation boundaries and fix unnecessary blocking.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote099Item9">• Use whole-number K input for context, compaction reserve and tool result history limits.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote099Item10">• Show the latest draft acceptance rate on the dashboard.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote099Item11">• Complete parameter command names, brief descriptions and Chinese/English tooltips.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote099Item12">• Refine model-type-specific parameter visibility, button layout and spacing.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote099Item13">• Expand concise and detailed diagnostic coverage for new features.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote098Title">0.9.8 · 2026-10-18</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote098Item1">• Add multiple configuration files</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote098Item2">• Separate model management and runtime parameters</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote098Item3">• Improve template and auxiliary file management</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote098Item4">• Add quick startup configuration selection</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote098Item5">• Add model card shortcuts</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote098Item6">• Add an OpenAI authentication toggle</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote098Item7">• Improve diagnostic logging</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote098Item8">• Refine the interface and tooltips</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote098Item9">• Fix boundary cases</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote098Item10">• Add a GitHub homepage shortcut</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote097Title">0.9.7 · 2026-10-07</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote097Item1">• Add per-model Codex SSE idle timeout adjustment.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote097Item2">• Improve reasoning effort validation and add the Thinking Settings tab.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote097Item3">• Fix CLI resolution for Desktop compatibility checks.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote097Item4">• Improve detection error handling.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote096Title">0.9.6 · 2026-10-06</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote096Item1">• Synchronized saved JSON/BAT and the active Local Router/catalog; cold launches apply the latest parameters and Codex settings.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote096Item2">• Added MTP/vision arguments to BAT scripts, shared generation rules and improved rollback on write failure.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote095Title">0.9.5 · 2026-10-04</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote095Item1">• Added Qwen/Unsloth template adaptation and management: detection and generation, source and validation status, folder access and built-in template restoration; extensible rules support future model families.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote095Item2">• Added Kotlin Daemon cache to common sandbox directories, with optional read/write access.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote094Title">0.9.4 · 2026-10-02</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote094Item1">• Refined parameter controls, card alignment, sidebar and adaptive window layout.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote094Item2">• Added concise/detailed logging and expanded fault diagnostics.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote094Item3">• Improved context, compaction reserve and tool-result limits, with context-shift capability checks.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote094Item4">• Improved sandbox network compatibility, common-directory selection and optional Gradle user-home configuration.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote093Title">0.9.3 · 2026-09-25</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote093Item1">• Added a version history tab to the About window.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote093Item2">• Added EXE installation, upgrade, and safe uninstall flows.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote092Title">0.9.2 · 2026-09-24</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote092Item1">• Added per-model network and directory permissions for the command sandbox.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote092Item2">• Added the llama.cpp Context Checkpoints option.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote092Item3">• OpenAI mode can display the history of earlier Local tasks.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote092Item4">• Improved scrolling in model management and search.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote091Title">0.9.1 · 2026-09-21</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote091Item1">• Improved Dense / MoE detection and model settings.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote091Item2">• Added per-model verification for vision, MTP, and reasoning levels.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote091Item3">• Added light and dark themes, Chinese and English, and more tray actions.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote091Item4">• Improved download cache detection, startup, and status reliability.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote090Title">0.9.0-beta · 2026-09-14</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote090Item1">• Introduced OpenAI and Local mode switching.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote090Item2">• Added llama.cpp model settings, loading, and runtime monitoring.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote090Item3">• Integrated Codex native local context compaction.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseNote090Item4">• Added recoverable configuration switching and a loopback safety proxy.</sys:String>
